 Install Python: Download from python.org and check the box "Add Python to PATH".

 Get an Editor: Install VS Code or Cursor, then add the Python and Jupyter extensions.

 Create Environment: Open your project folder, open the terminal, and run: python -m venv .venv

 Activate & Bind: Activate it (.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1) and select it in your editor via Command Palette (Ctrl+Shift+P -> Python: Select Interpreter).

 Install & Code: Run pip install for your packages (like numpy, pandas) and start  
